---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="blessed" title="Blessed Events" active="blessed-events" pageMark="✨">
  Every event the <strong>Blessed</strong> <a href={`${base}traits`}>trait</a> touches. Some need a Blessed
  character and bring good harvests, trades, births and truces. The rest give the trait, through the
  Oracle, a pilgrimage or surviving a wildfire. Blessed and <a href={`${base}cursed-events`}>Cursed</a> replace
  each other. These events also appear in their own category on <a href={`${base}events`}>Story Events</a>.
</EventGroupPage>
